# CRYPTO quick-win patches — verified anchors @ f54efb3b4a (.inspect-wt)
# Diff 1 = QW2 (prediction_market_consensus emitter: stop emitting entry_price=0 rows)
# Diff 2 = QW6 (template.html: 'awaiting price' instead of 0.00% for unpriced rows)
# Documents only — not applied. Re-grep anchors against production before merging.
--- a/alpha_engine/prediction_market_consensus.py
